<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 19.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 19.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- Parliament on Tuesday approved a bill on rules for municipal elections due to be held later this year, but opposition deputies are still pushing for changes to some clauses.</p>
<p>- The government has declared Mozambique's flood situation an emergency.</p>
